{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\"feel\":\"先前那种郑重而悬着的触动，在这里第一次变得可以安然停留：有温柔、亲近和真实的满足，也仍带着一点不敢把这份满足说得太满的克制。\",\"thread\":\"既然前面已经确认这件事确实重要，却还不知道该怎样回应，那么此刻真正得到的一份安稳和亲近就会格外有分量：它暂时不要求人先把事情想明白，而是让人直接经验到“留在这里是好的”。但这种好并没有回答先前悬着的问题，所以人可以真心沉浸其中，同时仍不把它当成已经解决。\",\"used\":\"第1段已经成立的两点：某种东西具有不能略过的真实分量；承认它的重要，并没有带来明确的所求或安顿办法。\",\"new\":[\"这件重要的东西不只是造成压力和迟疑，它也确实能够给人亲近、安稳而值得停留的满足。\",\"一份真实的满足可以暂时承接尚未想清楚的问题，却不等于已经回答了它。\"],\"unexplained\":\"无\"}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5e451374-d9e0-43f5-9722-a7a072cdf4c5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T224051539089Z", "elapsed_seconds": 10.656, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T22:41:02.207985+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8ad40e685d7abe41aac40615ed8f9f9597b7d6dbfe85c415ea83edbdcb46e545", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156de